AiTask qa9_inside_weekly_orders {
  label: 'QA9 Inside Weekly Orders'
  description: 'TEMP QA 9 Oct (nhi.ty): total orders for last week. Saved inside settings/ai/tasks. Sends nothing.'

  brief: @md
    Use only @Dataset:ecommerce_official. Count the orders created in the last completed Monday to Sunday week before the run date, and state the exact start and end dates.

    Report the total in one short sentence. Do not send email, Slack or any other delivery.
  ;;

  acceptance_criteria: @md
    - The output states the exact Monday and Sunday of the last completed week and the order count for it, queried fresh from @Dataset:ecommerce_official.
    - Nothing is sent by email, Slack or any other channel.
  ;;
}
